WEBVTT

00:00:00.750 --> 00:00:02.960
Your ears turned into pot stickers?

00:00:03.970 --> 00:00:10.180
She's hallucinating her child in order to 
protect herself from a painful reality.

00:00:10.680 --> 00:00:11.760
<i>Yuu-kun's—</i>

00:00:11.760 --> 00:00:14.180
<i>Excuse me, but who are you talking to?</i>

00:00:16.160 --> 00:00:22.450
<i>I have to cure her. After all, 
it's all my fault that he's gone.</i>

00:00:23.210 --> 00:00:24.960
The Pearl of Night Voices.

00:00:26.720 --> 00:00:32.470
As you speak to your mom through 
this, your voice will disappear.

00:00:33.420 --> 00:00:36.170
<b>Do Not Enter</b>

00:00:34.380 --> 00:00:39.470
In other words, this treatment 
method weighs you against that.

00:00:55.460 --> 00:00:56.440
Doctor!

00:00:56.710 --> 00:00:57.730
Doctor!

00:00:58.240 --> 00:00:59.440
Doctor!

00:01:05.020 --> 00:01:09.490
Because of me, the doctor is dead...

00:01:10.420 --> 00:01:11.690
Hey.

00:01:13.170 --> 00:01:15.590
Don't just assume I'm dead.

00:01:15.590 --> 00:01:17.590
Doctor, you're okay?

00:01:17.590 --> 00:01:20.530
Yeah, I'm used to getting beat up.

00:01:20.530 --> 00:01:22.630
This is nothing.

00:01:22.630 --> 00:01:23.610
What?

00:01:23.610 --> 00:01:26.120
Anyway, this isn't good.

00:01:26.120 --> 00:01:28.380
It won't be possible to climb back up.

00:02:57.230 --> 00:03:03.370
<b>Dr. Ramune
Mysterious Disease Specialist</b>

00:03:05.950 --> 00:03:09.960
<b>Episode 6 "Pot Sticker Ears – Part Two"</b>

00:03:17.120 --> 00:03:19.960
Doctor, are you cold?

00:03:21.270 --> 00:03:24.210
I'm fine. Don't worry about me. Just sleep.

00:03:26.400 --> 00:03:29.350
I'm too worried about my mom to sleep.

00:03:29.770 --> 00:03:32.980
Oh, right. What happened to your mom?

00:03:35.770 --> 00:03:38.480
Her pot stickers grew again.

00:03:38.830 --> 00:03:41.340
They're covering about half her ears.

00:03:41.910 --> 00:03:45.110
I wonder what's going to happen to her.

00:03:47.910 --> 00:03:49.780
It'll be one or the other.

00:03:52.610 --> 00:03:57.240
Either the pot stickers will grow large 
enough to completely block her ear holes,

00:03:57.850 --> 00:04:01.120
or she'll listen to the voices 
she was supposed to hear—

00:04:01.120 --> 00:04:03.170
the ones enveloped by the 
pot stickers—and be cured.

00:04:05.000 --> 00:04:07.860
Which do you think your mom wants?

00:04:10.290 --> 00:04:14.770
I think she'll probably choose 
to lose the ability to hear.

00:04:15.610 --> 00:04:17.680
I agree.

00:04:20.060 --> 00:04:24.810
But that's only if there's 
nothing on the scale.

00:04:25.280 --> 00:04:26.230
Rio!

00:04:26.520 --> 00:04:28.000
Rio!

00:04:30.480 --> 00:04:36.270
I understand what you mean when you talk 
about putting something on the scale.

00:04:37.320 --> 00:04:42.930
I want to cure my mom, but I've 
been too scared to use this.

00:04:44.170 --> 00:04:46.660
What are you so afraid of?

00:04:48.080 --> 00:04:51.250
It's my fault.

00:04:51.250 --> 00:04:53.210
It's my fault my brother is gone.

00:04:53.210 --> 00:04:55.180
It's my fault my mom is sick.

00:04:55.690 --> 00:04:59.950
My voice is the only one she can't hear at 
all because she doesn't want to hear it!

00:05:00.320 --> 00:05:03.010
My mom hates me.

00:05:03.010 --> 00:05:05.150
Even if it means her ears 
won't be cured, she...

00:05:05.880 --> 00:05:10.060
I've been afraid of that and 
haven't been able to use it.

00:05:14.390 --> 00:05:15.360
Listen, kid.

00:05:16.140 --> 00:05:18.370
You worry too much.

00:05:20.180 --> 00:05:23.300
Out of all your worries, which one 
do you want to fix the most?

00:05:25.800 --> 00:05:28.260
I want my mom to get better.

00:05:29.130 --> 00:05:32.360
All right. You understand what's important.

00:05:32.840 --> 00:05:37.530
I'm a great doctor, and I told you this is 
the most effective treatment method.

00:05:38.090 --> 00:05:39.880
What are you afraid of?

00:05:43.440 --> 00:05:46.780
Don't let yourself worry so much that
 you lose sight of what's important.

00:05:47.700 --> 00:05:50.680
If you want to solve a problem, 
you have to confront it.

00:05:51.660 --> 00:05:52.940
Confront it...

00:05:53.620 --> 00:05:55.950
Also, sorry.

00:05:56.770 --> 00:05:59.630
I'm going to get some sleep.

00:05:59.980 --> 00:06:02.910
But I promise I'll protect you...

00:06:09.000 --> 00:06:11.400
Doctor! Doctor!

00:06:19.060 --> 00:06:22.010
<i>He must've been scared of 
falling and getting hurt.</i>

00:06:22.500 --> 00:06:24.840
<i>But he protected me this whole time.</i>

00:06:31.760 --> 00:06:35.360
Mom! Mom, can you hear me?!

00:06:35.650 --> 00:06:38.510
Mom! Mom!

00:07:03.750 --> 00:07:05.140
Excuse me.

00:07:08.650 --> 00:07:09.710
Doctor?

00:07:11.880 --> 00:07:13.920
<i>Did he leave the lights on?</i>

00:07:23.850 --> 00:07:25.180
It's cold.

00:07:28.840 --> 00:07:31.190
He hasn't bought new milk.

00:07:31.880 --> 00:07:35.550
The cup he put in here yesterday 
is still here, which means...

00:07:36.020 --> 00:07:38.310
<i>He hasn't been back since last night?</i>

00:07:50.110 --> 00:07:51.430
What are we going to do?

00:07:51.430 --> 00:07:53.810
Rio. Rio...

00:07:54.550 --> 00:07:55.690
Excuse me.

00:07:55.690 --> 00:07:59.110
Your entryway was crowded, 
so I came around this way.

00:07:59.110 --> 00:08:00.700
Is the doctor here?

00:08:00.990 --> 00:08:04.170
You... You were at the shrine!

00:08:04.170 --> 00:08:05.630
Do you know where Rio is?!

00:08:05.840 --> 00:08:07.070
Rio-kun?

00:08:07.070 --> 00:08:09.210
He's been missing since yesterday!

00:08:09.630 --> 00:08:11.350
Excuse me. I'm coming inside.

00:08:11.730 --> 00:08:15.400
Last night, the doctor planned to come 
here with Rio-kun to check on you,

00:08:15.400 --> 00:08:18.600
but he never arrived, did he?

00:08:18.800 --> 00:08:22.340
No, but if he's with the doctor, 
then Rio should be...

00:08:22.540 --> 00:08:25.890
Unfortunately, I don't know 
where the doctor is, either.

00:08:25.890 --> 00:08:26.850
No...

00:08:27.680 --> 00:08:30.240
<i>Is there any way to 
determine their location?</i>

00:08:32.860 --> 00:08:33.350
What?

00:08:33.840 --> 00:08:35.940
<i>What would the doctor do?</i>

00:08:37.980 --> 00:08:39.990
Do you have the Pearl of Night Voices?

00:08:40.390 --> 00:08:42.780
Pearl of Night Voices?

00:08:42.780 --> 00:08:44.570
It's a conch with a pearl stuck to it.

00:08:44.790 --> 00:08:48.190
Did Rio-kun have a paper 
bag or box with him?

00:08:48.640 --> 00:08:50.400
Hey, maybe he means that.

00:08:55.120 --> 00:08:56.550
I knew it.

00:08:59.120 --> 00:09:00.860
What's going on?

00:09:01.950 --> 00:09:08.800
The pearl's grown, which means 
Rio-kun has been talking to you.

00:09:08.800 --> 00:09:11.180
Then Rio's all right?

00:09:11.480 --> 00:09:13.240
We're not out of the woods yet.

00:09:13.590 --> 00:09:18.830
The pearl's growth also indicates that 
Rio-kun's voice is disappearing.

00:09:19.090 --> 00:09:21.920
If we don't hurry, his voice 
will vanish completely,

00:09:21.920 --> 00:09:24.270
and we'll have no way to find him.

00:09:24.810 --> 00:09:29.960
Considering his life may be in 
danger, it's a matter of time.

00:09:31.010 --> 00:09:33.700
You can't hear Rio's voice, right?

00:09:33.700 --> 00:09:35.180
I'll listen instead.

00:09:35.180 --> 00:09:36.160
You can't.

00:09:37.310 --> 00:09:41.630
The doctor said that can only be used by 
a man and woman who love each other.

00:09:42.160 --> 00:09:46.170
Only his mother can hear Rio-kun's voice.

00:09:48.180 --> 00:09:51.880
Once your actual ears hear the 
voices you were supposed to hear

00:09:51.880 --> 00:09:55.780
but were blocked by the pot 
stickers, they'll come off.

00:09:56.070 --> 00:09:59.480
You'll be able to hear Rio's voice again.

00:10:04.670 --> 00:10:06.030
<i>What is this feeling?</i>

00:10:06.500 --> 00:10:08.620
<i>I feel like if I hear Rio's voice,</i>

00:10:08.620 --> 00:10:13.630
<i>then "something" will never come home again.</i>

00:10:16.160 --> 00:10:18.490
The pearl grew again.

00:10:18.490 --> 00:10:19.770
No...

00:10:19.770 --> 00:10:20.500
Rio!

00:10:21.310 --> 00:10:24.330
<i>But now... Right now, I have 
to listen to Rio's voice.</i>

00:10:24.780 --> 00:10:26.860
<i>Please, let me hear him.</i>

00:10:27.790 --> 00:10:30.380
<i>You don't have to envelope anything.</i>

00:10:30.380 --> 00:10:32.280
<i>I want to hear Rio's voice!</i>

00:10:35.800 --> 00:10:40.230
<i>Could you tell us about Yuu-kun's 
kidnapping and murder?</i>

00:10:40.540 --> 00:10:41.400
<i>What?</i>

00:10:41.400 --> 00:10:44.890
<i>Apparently his severed arm was discovered 
in the entryway of their home.</i>

00:10:44.890 --> 00:10:46.370
<i>We believe he left the house alone</i>

00:10:46.370 --> 00:10:49.420
<i>and was kidnapped by 
someone while he was out.</i>

00:10:49.730 --> 00:10:51.830
<i>What is this?</i>

00:10:52.430 --> 00:10:56.200
<i>Though we hate to give up 
hope, the situation is dire.</i>

00:10:56.200 --> 00:10:58.750
<i>I hope they find Yuu-kun soon.</i>

00:10:57.540 --> 00:11:00.920
<i>No... no... no...</i>

00:10:58.750 --> 00:11:00.920
<i>Regarding Yuu-kun's 
probability of survival...</i>

00:11:01.200 --> 00:11:03.920
No! I don't want to hear it!

00:11:04.620 --> 00:11:05.440
<i>It's no use.</i>

00:11:05.760 --> 00:11:07.360
The pot stickers are closing.

00:11:07.670 --> 00:11:11.200
<i>Any more, and Rio-kun's voice will vanish.</i>

00:11:11.700 --> 00:11:13.680
Mom...

00:11:14.660 --> 00:11:16.630
My voice...

00:11:17.260 --> 00:11:18.660
<i>Doctor...</i>

00:11:20.020 --> 00:11:21.840
Please, listen to him!

00:11:23.430 --> 00:11:26.190
You're the only one who can hear Rio's voice!

00:11:27.040 --> 00:11:28.240
Rio...

00:11:30.370 --> 00:11:34.490
<i>I have to listen to Rio's voice!</i>

00:11:36.500 --> 00:11:39.620
<i>The DNA matched Yuu-kun's.</i>

00:11:39.950 --> 00:11:44.870
<i>The police still haven't found any clues 
to the kidnapper's identity or goals.</i>

00:11:44.870 --> 00:11:46.830
<i>Tell us about the day of the incident.</i>

00:11:46.830 --> 00:11:48.610
<i>It could help solve the case.</i>

00:11:48.610 --> 00:11:52.630
<i>Apparently the wife hallucinates Yuu-kun.</i>

00:11:54.300 --> 00:11:56.090
Yuu, are you okay?!

00:11:56.090 --> 00:11:57.190
Did you get any on you?!

00:11:57.190 --> 00:12:00.210
Excuse me, but who are you talking to?

00:12:04.240 --> 00:12:05.710
Yuu...

00:12:05.710 --> 00:12:06.690
<i>That's right.</i>

00:12:07.700 --> 00:12:09.210
<i>Yuu will never...</i>

00:12:25.980 --> 00:12:28.590
<i>The pot stickers came off. Which means...</i>

00:12:28.590 --> 00:12:31.090
<i>Mom... Mom...</i>

00:12:31.700 --> 00:12:33.600
Rio? Is that you, Rio?

00:12:34.170 --> 00:12:36.480
<i>Mom, can you hear me?</i>

00:12:36.480 --> 00:12:38.600
I hear you. I can hear you.

00:12:38.970 --> 00:12:42.170
You're all right. Where are you?

00:12:42.570 --> 00:12:46.610
What? The woods? You're with the doctor?

00:12:46.960 --> 00:12:48.160
You fell?!

00:12:50.300 --> 00:12:52.340
Wh-What? Hey, wait!

00:12:52.930 --> 00:12:57.420
There's a spot on the road overlooking 
the woods between the shrine and here.

00:12:57.750 --> 00:12:59.470
They're most likely there.

00:13:01.060 --> 00:13:02.220
I'm going to borrow this.

00:13:02.220 --> 00:13:04.420
I'll leave a trail for you to follow.

00:13:04.760 --> 00:13:06.510
Call for help immediately.

00:13:06.510 --> 00:13:08.670
I'll go find them.

00:13:21.820 --> 00:13:23.940
<b>Do Not Enter</b>

00:13:26.510 --> 00:13:28.760
<i>There are signs that 
people came through here.</i>

00:13:59.310 --> 00:14:01.440
Doctor! Rio-kun!

00:14:08.370 --> 00:14:09.570
I'll be right there!

00:14:15.470 --> 00:14:16.370
Doctor!

00:14:17.110 --> 00:14:19.560
Doctor, wake up.

00:14:23.370 --> 00:14:24.180
Hey.

00:14:26.600 --> 00:14:28.400
Are you okay to sit up?

00:14:29.560 --> 00:14:32.570
I'm just barely okay. Ow...

00:14:32.570 --> 00:14:36.070
I'll perform what first aid 
I can until help arrives.

00:14:38.780 --> 00:14:41.310
<i>Rio-kun doesn't seem to be visibly injured.</i>

00:14:41.610 --> 00:14:45.840
<i>His raincoat has helped reduce 
the effects of hypothermia, but...</i>

00:14:47.780 --> 00:14:48.830
What?

00:14:49.160 --> 00:14:52.290
Doctor, you'll going to catch a chill
from your wet clothes.

00:14:53.420 --> 00:14:55.400
I'll lend you mine. Take those off.

00:14:55.400 --> 00:14:58.300
What? I'm fine.

00:14:58.300 --> 00:14:59.960
You called for help, right?

00:14:59.960 --> 00:15:01.790
It's better than nothing.

00:15:01.110 --> 00:15:03.570
No, seriously. I'm fine.

00:15:03.570 --> 00:15:05.160
Why are you so reluctant?

00:15:03.710 --> 00:15:05.160
Hey, quit pulling on—

00:15:09.570 --> 00:15:11.800
Kuro-san?

00:15:15.310 --> 00:15:21.570
I'd love to punch you, but I feel like 
it would kill you, so I won't for now.

00:15:22.100 --> 00:15:24.810
Anyway! Since you're here, doesn't that mean...

00:15:25.230 --> 00:15:28.100
Your mother's pot stickers came off.

00:15:28.100 --> 00:15:30.570
Your voice reached her.

00:15:32.900 --> 00:15:34.660
That's great, Rio.

00:15:37.470 --> 00:15:40.730
Okay, okay! Hey, time out!

00:15:44.870 --> 00:15:46.450
Sounds like help has arrived.

00:15:46.450 --> 00:15:47.840
I'll let them know where you are.

00:15:48.260 --> 00:15:49.340
Please!

00:16:00.110 --> 00:16:00.860
Rio!

00:16:05.910 --> 00:16:06.970
<i>His voice...</i>

00:16:08.250 --> 00:16:10.260
I'm sorry, Rio.

00:16:10.770 --> 00:16:13.220
I'm sorry I didn't notice sooner.

00:16:14.220 --> 00:16:17.870
But I'm so glad you're all right.

00:16:25.250 --> 00:16:29.250
<b>Shiranui General Hospital</b>

00:16:40.160 --> 00:16:41.720
Hey, Kuro.

00:16:45.720 --> 00:16:47.350
Thanks for bringing a change of clothes.

00:16:48.860 --> 00:16:51.690
What? Are you mad? Why?

00:16:51.690 --> 00:16:55.060
Why don't you look inside yourself 
for the answer to that question?

00:16:55.060 --> 00:16:58.100
Or rather, around your waist.

00:17:02.160 --> 00:17:06.520
You had your Shoji Vision and Moke with you.

00:17:07.070 --> 00:17:09.370
If you'd used them like 
you did the other day,

00:17:10.360 --> 00:17:13.340
you could've been rescued right away!

00:17:14.340 --> 00:17:16.820
No, it's not what you think.

00:17:16.820 --> 00:17:21.100
If Rio had been in serious danger, 
I would've used them immediately.

00:17:21.480 --> 00:17:25.740
But when I see the chance to cure someone
 right before my eyes, I end up choosing that.

00:17:26.090 --> 00:17:30.440
I really was prioritizing 
Rio's physical well-being.

00:17:30.440 --> 00:17:33.390
I don't want you to think I was 
putting him in danger or—

00:17:33.390 --> 00:17:35.110
I'm <i>not</i> talking about Rio-kun!

00:17:39.880 --> 00:17:43.110
Oh, sorry.

00:17:43.110 --> 00:17:45.370
Looks like I made you worry.

00:17:45.640 --> 00:17:51.420
Hypothermia, blood loss, bruises, 
and a broken left ankle.

00:17:51.420 --> 00:17:53.880
The doctor said you would've 
died if it had been winter.

00:17:55.170 --> 00:17:56.800
Sorry.

00:17:56.800 --> 00:17:57.890
Also...

00:17:57.890 --> 00:18:00.890
Rio Kidnapping Plan

00:17:58.310 --> 00:18:00.340
There's something I'd like to ask you.

00:18:00.930 --> 00:18:02.970
I found this in your consultation room.

00:18:02.970 --> 00:18:06.230
You wrote this, didn't you?

00:18:06.230 --> 00:18:08.600
Huh? Oh, that...

00:18:08.870 --> 00:18:12.330
I'd like you to explain
 exactly what this means.

00:18:12.620 --> 00:18:18.040
In order to treat Rio, I got his father's 
authorization for a bunch of things.

00:18:18.040 --> 00:18:24.740
I intended to do it in a safe and planned 
manner, but then that accident happened.

00:18:25.120 --> 00:18:29.160
Unbelievable. Your methods are so 
drastic, they're indefensible.

00:18:29.160 --> 00:18:30.010
What?!

00:18:30.280 --> 00:18:34.510
Speaking of, after this incident, 
you're under suspicion for kidnapping.

00:18:34.510 --> 00:18:36.250
For kidnapping?!

00:18:41.180 --> 00:18:45.390
No! Kuro, don't abandon me!

00:18:45.860 --> 00:18:49.860
It would be best if Rio-kun could 
testify that you didn't kidnap him,

00:18:49.860 --> 00:18:51.440
but he can't speak.

00:18:51.860 --> 00:18:52.800
Oh, right!

00:19:02.110 --> 00:19:05.110
Hey, Rio. How are you feeling?

00:19:09.200 --> 00:19:12.250
I see. I'm glad you seem to be doing well.

00:19:12.560 --> 00:19:14.800
Thanks to you, he's not even injured.

00:19:14.800 --> 00:19:16.940
How are you doing, Doctor?

00:19:16.940 --> 00:19:20.890
I'm really lucky I only got a few scrapes.

00:19:21.550 --> 00:19:22.840
<i>Liar.</i>

00:19:24.430 --> 00:19:27.390
This is the Pearl of Night Voices Rio used.

00:19:27.790 --> 00:19:33.620
You're supposed to exchange the pearls you 
nurtured with your voices and eat them, but...

00:19:35.120 --> 00:19:39.160
Rio himself will eat the pearl 
he nurtured with his voice.

00:19:46.860 --> 00:19:50.120
By the time that pearl melts 
completely, your voice will return.

00:19:51.890 --> 00:19:55.490
The pearl can be melted by 
speaking directly to each other.

00:19:55.490 --> 00:19:59.430
In other words, the two 
of you should talk a lot.

00:19:59.760 --> 00:20:02.330
<i>I can talk to my mom?</i>

00:20:04.090 --> 00:20:06.710
<i>I hope my mom gets better.</i>

00:20:07.070 --> 00:20:10.300
<i>I wonder if I'll get to talk to her again.</i>

00:20:14.160 --> 00:20:15.500
Thank you.

00:20:16.660 --> 00:20:19.520
You're welcome.

00:20:25.980 --> 00:20:26.840
Here.

00:20:26.840 --> 00:20:27.580
Thanks.

00:20:28.360 --> 00:20:33.160
This is what you intended to do from the 
start, even if Rio-kun lost his voice, right?

00:20:33.420 --> 00:20:34.740
You idiot.

00:20:34.740 --> 00:20:36.470
If her ears hadn't gotten better,

00:20:36.470 --> 00:20:39.420
they wouldn't be able to talk, which
 he needs to get his voice back.

00:20:39.920 --> 00:20:42.530
I intended to cure her from the start.

00:20:43.410 --> 00:20:47.990
But from this point on, I won't
 be able to help them.

00:20:48.690 --> 00:20:53.090
What's important is that they 
understand each other's pain.

00:20:50.770 --> 00:20:53.100
<b>Akagi Clinic</b>

00:20:50.770 --> 00:20:53.100
<b>Psychodiagnosis & Neurology</b>

00:20:50.770 --> 00:20:53.100
<b>Akagi Clinic</b>

00:20:53.420 --> 00:20:57.350
It's not a betrayal to look forward.

00:21:00.570 --> 00:21:05.100
I'm hopeless. I keep making enough for Yuu.

00:21:10.330 --> 00:21:11.500
Rio...

00:21:18.430 --> 00:21:20.170
We'll share it.

00:21:22.400 --> 00:21:25.010
Yeah, you're right.

00:21:29.760 --> 00:21:31.260
Thanks for the food.

00:21:32.020 --> 00:21:35.020
<b>Shiranui General Hospital</b>

00:21:35.560 --> 00:21:39.900
Goodness, how could you injure yourself
 this badly while trying to cure a patient?

00:21:40.280 --> 00:21:42.170
You're such a softie.

00:21:42.170 --> 00:21:42.710
Ow.

00:21:42.710 --> 00:21:44.950
Now, now, Grandma...

00:21:45.770 --> 00:21:48.870
Grandma, what are you doing?!

00:21:45.780 --> 00:21:49.280
<b>Softie</b>

00:21:49.290 --> 00:21:51.950
Kuro, help me.

00:21:49.520 --> 00:21:51.320
This is great.

00:21:52.340 --> 00:21:54.150
You did this to yourself.

00:23:25.790 --> 00:23:27.410
<i>Hey, Kuropi.</i>

00:23:28.440 --> 00:23:31.180
<i>Kuromaru, Kurotan, Kuropi.</i>

00:23:31.180 --> 00:23:33.970
<i>I'll stuff your mouth full of popcorn.</i>

00:23:33.970 --> 00:23:35.430
Dr. Ramune -Mysterious Disease Specialist-.

